the book starts to look suspicious... (JS)} f4 32. a3 b5 33. Rb1 Rd6 34. Ra1
Bb7 35. Kd1 e5 36. dxe5+ Kxe5 37. Ke2 Kf6 38. Re1 Re6 39. Kf2 Ke5 40. Rb1 Ra6
