Bauza, 16 April 2020. BCM, Sept 1947, p292, commented: "Berger-Schenk lacked
precision on both sides with Schenk the greater sinner." Number of moves
recorded as 41. There remains a slight mystery as to why Black should have
resigned (the score gives 'resigns' explicitly).} 1-0

